---
import { GITHUB } from "../consts";
---

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="wrap footer-inner">
    <div class="foot-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="foot-mark" aria-hidden="true">
          <i style="--c: var(--yellow)"></i>
          <i style="--c: var(--coral)"></i>
          <i style="--c: var(--blue)"></i>
          <i style="--c: var(--mint)"></i>
          <i style="--c: var(--violet)"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="foot-word">pi-rs</div>
        <p class="foot-tag">
          奥卡姆剃刀：如无必要，勿增实体。<br />
          四块积木，一条单向依赖，没有魔法。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="foot-cols">
        <div>
          <p class="foot-heading">项目</p>
          <ul>
            <li><a href={GITHUB} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a></li>
            <li><a href={`${GITHUB}/issues`} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Issues</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://pi.dev" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">灵感：pi.dev</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="foot-heading">文档</p>
          <ul>
            <li><a href={`${GITHUB}/tree/main/docs`} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">文档索引</a></li>
            <li><a href={`${GITHUB}/blob/main/docs/architecture.md`} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">架构</a></li>
            <li><a href={`${GITHUB}/blob/main/docs/development.md`} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">开发指南</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="foot-heading">本页</p>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="#why">哲学</a></li>
            <li><a href="#tools">四块积木</a></li>
            <li><a href="#not-built">没造的东西</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="foot-bottom">
      <span>MIT · Rust 2021 · 用 Astro 堆的这页</span>
      <span>没有魔法，只有积木。© 2026 pi-rs</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
